{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\ndef solve():\n    n, mod = map(int, input().split())\n    m = n * (n - 1) // 2\n    max_inv = n * (n - 1)\n    dp = [[0] * (max_inv + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    dp1 = [[0] * (max_inv + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    dp[1][m] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        start_x = m - (i - 1) * (i - 2) // 2\n        end_x = m + (i - 1) * (i - 2) // 2\n        for x in range(start_x, end_x + 1):\n            for d in range(-i + 1, i):\n                dp[i][x + d] = (dp[i][x + d] + dp[i - 1][x] * (i - abs(d))) % mod\n    \n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        start_x = m - (i - 1) * (i - 2) // 2\n        end_x = m + (i - 1) * (i - 2) // 2\n        for x in range(start_x, end_x + 1):\n            dp1[i][x] = dp1[i - 1][x] * i % mod\n        for x in range(start_x, end_x + 1):\n            for d in range(1, i):\n                dp1[i][x - d] = (dp1[i][x - d] + dp[i - 1][x] * (i - d)) % mod\n    \n    return sum(dp1[-1][m + 1:]) % mod\n\nimport sys\ninput = lambda: sys.stdin.readline().rstrip()\nprint(solve())\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long solve() {\n    long long n, mod;\n    cin >> n >> mod;\n    \n    long long m = n * (n - 1) / 2;\n    long long max_inv = n * (n - 1);\n    \n    vector<vector<long long>> dp(n + 1, vector<long long>(max_inv + 1, 0));\n    vector<vector<long long>> dp1(n + 1, vector<long long>(max_inv + 1, 0));\n    \n    dp[1][m] = 1;\n    \n    for (long long i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n        long long start_x = m - (i - 1) * (i - 2) / 2;\n        long long end_x = m + (i - 1) * (i - 2) / 2;\n        for (long long x = start_x; x <= end_x; x++) {\n            for (long long d = -i + 1; d < i; d++) {\n                if (x + d >= 0 && x + d <= max_inv) {\n                    dp[i][x + d] = (dp[i][x + d] + dp[i - 1][x] * (i - abs(d))) % mod;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    for (long long i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n        long long start_x = m - (i - 1) * (i - 2) / 2;\n        long long end_x = m + (i - 1) * (i - 2) / 2;\n        for (long long x = start_x; x <= end_x; x++) {\n            dp1[i][x] = (dp1[i - 1][x] * i) % mod;\n        }\n        for (long long x = start_x; x <= end_x; x++) {\n            for (long long d = 1; d < i; d++) {\n                if (x - d >= 0 && x - d <= max_inv) {\n                    dp1[i][x - d] = (dp1[i][x - d] + dp[i - 1][x] * (i - d)) % mod;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    long long result = 0;\n    for (long long x = m + 1; x <= max_inv; x++) {\n        result = (result + dp1[n][x]) % mod;\n    }\n    \n    return result;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    cout << solve() << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.86750388215296e-05, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -3.683499380713329e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00015138434537220746, -9.059